"><p><bold>Notes:</bold></p></fn><fn id="tfn8-copd-8-389"><label>a</label><p>Mcnemar&#x02019;s test;</p></fn><fn id="tfn9-copd-8-389"><label>b</label><p><italic>t</italic>-test for two related samples; NA, not applicable.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>